{"id":"cf0fb3021021d3e4","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful.md","title":"Theorem — Yoneda is Fully Faithful","display":"Theorem — Yoneda is Fully Faithful","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful","aliases":["14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful"],"display":"Theorem — Yoneda is Fully Faithful","depends_on":["[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Yoneda is Fully Faithful"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1291f8efcdef81cf\" href=\"?note=1291f8efcdef81cf\" title=\"14-thm-yoneda-lemma\">14-thm-yoneda-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(y=\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a>。完全忠实见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(y)\\to\\mathrm{IsFullyFaithful}(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(y)\\to\\mathrm{IsFullyFaithful}(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.1，Yoneda 嵌入及引理，印刷页 26；DjVu 第 19 图页。把 Yoneda 引理中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(B)\">\\(y(B)\\)</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}(y(A),y(B))\\cong y(B)(A)=\\mathrm{Hom}(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}(y(A),y(B))\\cong y(B)(A)=\\mathrm{Hom}(A,B)\\)</span>；其逆正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\mapsto y(f)\">\\(f\\mapsto y(f)\\)</span>，故每个 Hom 上映射双射。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-yoneda-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"1291f8efcdef81cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$y=\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}$ 满足 [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]。完全忠实见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$y=\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}$ 满足 [[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]。完全忠实见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"y=\\mathbf y_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsYonedaEmbedding}(y)\\to\\mathrm{IsFullyFaithful}(y).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"y(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}(y(A),y(B))\\cong y(B)(A)=\\mathrm{Hom}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\mapsto y(f)","display":false}],"bytes":1028,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful|Theorem — Yoneda is Fully Faithful]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-fully-faithful|Theorem — Yoneda is Fully Faithful]]"},{"id":"cb7eec83c9952d6f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["99b72d10a7d872f5","1291f8efcdef81cf","